        "summary":  "Dan Roberts presents an updated leadership framework for the AI era built around seven competencies: Coherence, Communication, Currency, Confidence, Conviction, Courage, and Change. The framework addresses compressed decision cycles and organizational transformation driven by accelerating AI adoption. Roberts illustrates each competency with examples from accomplished CIOs and argues they form a reinforcing flywheel.",
        "execSummary":  "Enterprise leaders navigating AI-driven transformation need an updated competency model, not just new tools. Roberts\u0027 seven Cs provide a practical diagnostic for evaluating where leadership teams are strong or exposed as AI reshapes org design and decision velocity. For customer-support leaders, Currency (staying current on AI capabilities) and Conviction (committing to AI-led operating models) are the highest-leverage levers. Leaders who treat this as a technology upgrade rather than a leadership evolution will find their orgs outpaced.",
