        "summary":  "AI agent adoption is projected to surge 300% over the next two years, forcing organizations to reconfigure roles and responsibilities rather than simply add AI tools. Successful integration requires reskilling employees toward higher-value work, establishing governance frameworks, and sustaining workplace culture through well-being programs. Leadership must adopt change management strategies that keep humans in the loop while optimizing human-AI collaboration.",
