        "summary":  "Although 85% of organizations aspire to implement agentic AI within three years, 76% report their current infrastructure cannot support this transformation. Layering AI agents onto existing legacy operations is insufficient; enterprises must undertake systems-level change across technology, workforce, and performance metrics. The article introduces the concept of \u0027agentic business transformation\u0027 as the required frame for this shift.",
